# fn-ignis Operating Protocol for OpenAI Codex Agents

Read `AGENTS.md` for repository-wide boundaries and release gates. If explicitly asked to set
up this repository, run `./scripts/bootstrap.sh`.

Ignis does not collect data in the background. Begin only an explicitly assigned source probe
or research mission. Use `.agents/skills/ignis-collect/SKILL.md` for bounded collection and
`.agents/skills/ignis-analyze/SKILL.md` for mission-grounded Market analysis. The two skills
are independent: collection may end with an evidence frame, and analysis must return a Gap
Report rather than an unsupported verdict when its gates fail.

Use the current MCP tool catalog, not historical Dual-Track instructions. Do not treat a
user-uploaded or purchased dataset as primary Market evidence without mission-scoped provenance
and qualification. Do not run a worker, daily discovery, or recurring baseline.
